- 2026-11-10: Corrected preview and apply created the actual issue and one
  In Progress Project item. The persistent backlink is the verified issue URL.
- 2026-11-10: Initial source gates passed Ruff, Black and mypy; pytest reported
  770 passed and two theme-reopen failures. The Qt-free import test reloaded
  palette classes shared by later tests. Isolated that import in a fresh child
  instead of weakening the reopen assertions; the full gate must be rerun.
- 2026-11-10: Corrected full source release gates passed with 772 tests.
  Complete public payload review retains the existing fictional media; align
  the release notes and guides without changing the source launcher or inputs.
